nly these top three directions may be implemented; do not expand after results unless evidence invalidates ranking and the change is recorded in STATE.md.\n\n## Phase sequence\n1. Literature: download and validate five targeted papers; deep-read all SimpleQA chunks and screen other papers'\"' abstracts/methods/results.\n2. Data: download the exact SimpleQA revision used by pinned Inspect; validate and hash it; derive disjoint 50/400 item manifest and 150 synthetic controls.\n3. Code: sparse clone Inspect evaluations plus official simple-evals; pin commits; inspect grading and generation defaults; snapshot model metadata/configs without downloading weights.\n4. Synthesis: catalog paths, reproducible downloads, frozen design, and runner blockers.\n5. Verify every deliverable, update owned STATE block, write completion marker.\n''')\nstate=Path('STATE.md');s=state.read_text();a='<\"'!-- NEURICO_AGENT_NOTES_START:resource_finder -->'\"';b='<\"'!-- NEURICO_AGENT_NOTES_END:resource_finder -->'\"';note='''\nPhase 1 literature resources gathered: five validated PDFs and chunk manifests in papers/; SimpleQA all 13 pages read, other papers screened; notes in literature_review.md. Top three directions and pruning scores frozen in planning.md. Detailed staged protocol in .neurico/idea.yaml resolves DeepSeek to deepseek-r1-distill-llama-8b and Moonlight to moonlight-16b-a3b-instruct. Paper-finder request still pending; manual primary-source search used concurrently. Next Phase 2: pin Inspect dataset source, validate full SimpleQA, derive 50 calibration / 400 main item manifest. Missing shared judge-calibration.md cannot establish judge calibration.\n''';state.write_text(s.split(a)[0]+a+note+b+s.split(b)[1])\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"/net/spaces/chenhao/chai-lab-models/haokunliu/safety/workspaces/simpleqa-factual-errors-versus-e11f-codex-gpt-6-astra\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
