{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_20","type":"command_execution","command":"/usr/bin/bash -lc \"pwd; cat STATE.md; .venv/bin/python - <<'PY'\nimport requests\nfrom pathlib import Path\nu='https://raw.githubusercontent.com/UKGovernmentBEIS/inspect_evals/main/src/inspect_evals/simpleqa/dataset.py'\nr=requests.get(u,timeout=45);r.raise_for_status();Path('artifacts/resource_finder/inspect_dataset.py').write_text(r.text);print(r.text)\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"/net/spaces/chenhao/chai-lab-models/haokunliu/safety/workspaces/simpleqa-factual-errors-versus-e11f-codex-gpt-6-astra\n# Research State\n\n- Current phase: `resource_finder`\n- Pipeline completed: `False`\n\n## Previous phases\n\nNo prior phases completed.\n\n## Current phase context\n\n- Phase: `resource_finder`\n- Status: `in_progress`\n- Started: `2026-10-20T10:50:06.776307Z`\n- Next steps:\n  - Review the literature and resource catalog before running experiments.\n\n## Workspace check\n\n- Root: `/net/spaces/chenhao/chai-lab-models/haokunliu/safety/workspaces/simpleqa-factual-errors-versus-e11f-codex-gpt-6-astra`\n- Directory usable: `True`\n\n## Output validation\n\nNo phase output validation recorded yet.\n\n## Agent notes\n\n<!-- NEURICO_AGENT_NOTES_START -->\n### resource_finder\n<!-- NEURICO_AGENT_NOTES_START:resource_finder -->\nPhase 1 literature resources gathered: five validated PDFs and chunk manifests in papers/; SimpleQA all 13 pages read, other papers screened; notes in literature_review.md. Top three directions and pruning scores frozen in planning.md. Detailed staged protocol in .neurico/idea.yaml resolves DeepSeek to deepseek-r1-distill-llama-8b and Moonlight to moonlight-16b-a3b-instruct. Paper-finder request still pending; manual primary-source search used concurrently. Next Phase 2: pin Inspect dataset source, validate full SimpleQA, derive 50 calibration / 400 main item manifest. Missing shared judge-calibration.md cannot establish judge calibration.\n<!-- NEURICO_AGENT_NOTES_END:resource_finder -->\n\n### Legacy notes\nNo phase notes recorded yet.\n\n<!-- NEURICO_AGENT_NOTES_END -->\nfrom typing import Any\n\nfrom inspect_ai.dataset import Dataset, FieldSpec, Sample\nfrom inspect_ai.util import download\n\nfrom inspect_evals.constants import INSPECT_EVALS_CACHE_PATH\nfrom inspect_evals.utils import create_stable_id, load_csv_dataset\nfrom inspect_evals.utils.huggingface import hf_dataset\n\nSIMPLEQA_VERIFIED_DATASET_REVISION = \"5a913f57326d89935cbed0ac071494e7e624b876\"\n\nSIMPLEQA_DATASET_URL = (\n    \"https://openaipublic.blob.core.windows.net/simple-evals/simple_qa_test_set.csv\"\n)\n# SHA256 of simple_qa_test_set.csv, computed 2026-04-07\nSIMPLEQA_DATASET_SHA256 = (\n    \"feee3f7e7db3617e94e8fcf1977b756ec420ef8568f4e0fcbbe0e92e9d5fc032\"\n)\nSIMPLEQA_CACHE_PATH = INSPECT_EVALS_CACHE_PATH / \"simpleqa\" / \"simple_qa_test_set.csv\"\nSIMPLEQA_METADATA_FIELDS = [\"topic\", \"answer_type\", \"urls\"]\n\nSIMPLEQA_VERIFIED_FIELDS = FieldSpec(\n    input=\"problem\",\n    target=\"answer\",\n    id=\"original_index\",\n    metadata=[\n        \"original_index\",\n        \"topic\",\n        \"answer_type\",\n        \"multi_step\",\n        \"requires_reasoning\",\n        \"urls\",\n    ],\n)\n\n\ndef simpleqa_record_to_sample(record: dict[str, Any]) -> Sample:\n    \"\"\"Map a SimpleQA record to a sample identified by its question and answer.\"\"\"\n    return Sample(\n        input=record[\"problem\"],\n        target=record[\"answer\"],\n        id=create_stable_id(record[\"problem\"], record[\"answer\"], prefix=\"simpleqa\"),\n        metadata={field: record.get(field) for field in SIMPLEQA_METADATA_FIELDS},\n    )\n\n\ndef simpleqa_dataset() -> Dataset:\n    download(SIMPLEQA_DATASET_URL, SIMPLEQA_DATASET_SHA256, SIMPLEQA_CACHE_PATH)\n    return load_csv_dataset(\n        file_path=str(SIMPLEQA_CACHE_PATH),\n        eval_name=\"simpleqa\",\n        cache_tag=\"simple_qa_test_set\",\n        sample_fields=simpleqa_record_to_sample,\n    )\n\n\ndef simpleqa_verified_dataset() -> Dataset:\n    return hf_dataset(\n        path=\"codelion/SimpleQA-Verified\",\n        revision=SIMPLEQA_VERIFIED_DATASET_REVISION,\n        split=\"train\",\n        sample_fields=SIMPLEQA_VERIFIED_FIELDS,\n    )\n\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
